# Local working copy of the skill, so Claude Code loads it when opened here.
# Deliberately untracked: the repo root IS the skill, and committing a second
# copy of it would guarantee the two drift. Refresh with scripts/sync_skill.sh.
.claude/

# Generated output — examples regenerate everything under out/
out/
render/
*.hwpx
*.hwp
# 예외: 예제가 채우는 빈 양식. 정부 배포 서식이라 내용이 비어 있다.
!examples/forms/*.hwp
# 예외: README 에서 내려받는 결과물 견본. out/ 은 예제가 덮어쓰는 작업 공간이라
# 여기에 사본을 두고 커밋한다. 갱신은 scripts/sync_samples.sh 로 한다.
!docs/samples/*.hwpx

# Images of unrecorded provenance. Showcase renders under docs/images/ are
# generated by the examples in this repo and are committed deliberately.
/img*.png

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
